<p>Fade into the darkness and reappear elsewhere within range <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">3, 4, 5, 6, 7.</acronym>  When you emerge from the shadows, you are accompanied by a bright flash, dealing <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>spellpower 100">121, 163, 195, 223, 247</acronym> light damage to enemies in radius 1.</p><p> The damage will increase with your Spellpower.</p>